/T (Each leading platform operates on a distinct architectural philosophy. OutSystems focuses on compiled standard code generation \(.NET/C# and JavaScript\) that runs natively in cloud or on-premise environments. Mendix employs a model-driven, cloud-native architecture using a Java-based runtime on Cloud Foundry and Kubernetes. Microsoft Power Apps leverages an interpreted low-code layer built natively upon Microsoft Dataverse and Azure services.)
/E (Each leading platform operates on a distinct architectural philosophy. OutSystems focuses on compiled standard code generation \(.NET/C# and JavaScript\) that runs natively in cloud or on-premise environments. Mendix employs a model-driven, cloud-native architecture using a Java-based runtime on Cloud Foundry and Kubernetes. Microsoft Power Apps leverages an interpreted low-code layer built natively upon Microsoft Dataverse and Azure services.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
