/T (Low-Code Development Platforms \(LCDPs\) have transitioned from simple rapid application development tools to central pillars of modern enterprise IT strategy. Driven by increasing demand for digital transformation, acute developer shortages, and the need for agility, organizations are heavily adopting low-code solutions. These platforms enable professional developers and citizen developers alike to construct robust, enterprise-grade applications using visual declarative interfaces, pre-built components, and automated deployment pipelines.)
/E (Low-Code Development Platforms \(LCDPs\) have transitioned from simple rapid application development tools to central pillars of modern enterprise IT strategy. Driven by increasing demand for digital transformation, acute developer shortages, and the need for agility, organizations are heavily adopting low-code solutions. These platforms enable professional developers and citizen developers alike to construct robust, enterprise-grade applications using visual declarative interfaces, pre-built components, and automated deployment pipelines.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [8]
